      "normalizedSource": "On compatible devices, the Camera app captures all photos as Live Photos by default, but the [`imagePickerController:didFinishPickingImage:editingInfo:`](uiimagepickercontrollerdelegate/imagepickercontroller:didfinishpickingimage:editinginfo:.md) method’s `image` parameter contains only the still image representation.",
