      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "To obtain the motion and sound content of a live photo for display (using the [`PHLivePhotoView`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/PhotosUI/PHLivePhotoView) class), include the `kUTTypeImage` and `kUTTypeLivePhoto` identifiers in the allowed media types when configuring an image picker controller.",
