      "contextAfter": "When the user picks or captures a Live Photo, the `editingInfo` dictionary contains the [`livePhoto`](uiimagepickercontroller/infokey/livephoto.md) key, with a [`PHLivePhoto`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Photos/PHLivePhoto) representation of the photo as the corresponding value.",
